<title>SWEDEN: Trading in Assa Abloy suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Trading in Assa Abloy suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that trading in shares of lock manufacturer Assa Abloy were suspended.</p>
<p>The company earlier called a press conference at 0830 GMT on Wednesday at its head office in Stockholm.</p>
<p>&quot;It's concerning a large transaction,&quot; Assa Abloy chief executive Carl-Henric Svanberg told Reuters.</p>
<p>Assa Abloy shares closed on Tuesday at 151 crowns after rising five crowns.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
